WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:05.160
The Gorosei are immortal and incredibly powerful
rulers from the void century that have been

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:08.429
ruling the world together with Imu for the
last 800 years.

00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:13.709
For one, we know that they haven't aged a
day since the incident of Ohara 20 years ago.

00:00:13.709 --> 00:00:19.230
They are called the 5 elder stars even though
some of them are not old at all.

00:00:19.230 --> 00:00:22.900
They clearly know everything about the true
history and what happened during the void

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:31.690
century, as we can see when Dr. Clover tries
to say the ancient kingdom's name.

00:00:31.690 --> 00:00:37.090
And we know that they are the highest ranking
celestial dragons, the world nobles who never

00:00:37.090 --> 00:00:38.360
leave the Red line.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:42.730
So why exactly would they be covered in scars
and carry weapons?

00:00:42.730 --> 00:00:48.770
If just one of them decided to go out on an
adventure, that might be an excuse, but all

00:00:48.770 --> 00:00:49.770
of them?

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:55.649
The world government has existed for 800 years,
so there clearly never was any reason for

00:00:55.649 --> 00:00:58.789
celestial dragons to fight themselves.

00:00:58.789 --> 00:01:04.290
Heck, even against Rocks, the biggest threat
to the government we know of, Garp had to

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:11.910
team up with Roger to defeat him.

00:01:11.910 --> 00:01:18.570
If the Gorosei were immortal however, they
could be the very kings who defeated the ancient

00:01:18.570 --> 00:01:22.000
kingdom and formed the world government in
the first place.

00:01:22.000 --> 00:01:27.500
They would have actively fought in the big
war itself and then kept control ever since.

00:01:27.500 --> 00:01:32.940
That would also explain, why they look and
act completely normal, compared to the other

00:01:32.940 --> 00:01:38.770
dumbed down and spoiled Celestial dragons,
who have probably only had children within

00:01:38.770 --> 00:01:40.820
their small group of chosen ones.

00:01:40.820 --> 00:01:44.170
Yes, I'm saying there might be some incest
problem going on here.

00:01:44.170 --> 00:01:50.670
I mean look at this.

00:01:50.670 --> 00:01:51.670
[]

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:55.350
All of them run around in their space suits,
shielding them from the air normal humans

00:01:55.350 --> 00:02:00.960
breathe, while the Gorosei have normal cloths
and have no problem being in the same room

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:03.780
with Akainu or even Shanks.

00:02:03.780 --> 00:02:09.840
And so all these pieces of evidence together
strongly suggest to me, that these five men

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:15.530
are the original celestial dragons that founded
the world government with the help of Imu.

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:20.840
Which would also help in keeping the secret
ruler of the world secret, since they would

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:27.500
have been the only 5 people who knew the truth
since the void century, with no need to pass

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.040
it all on every generation and risking exposure.

00:02:31.040 --> 00:02:34.740
But how did they end up becoming immortal
in the first place?

00:02:34.740 --> 00:02:40.180
How powerful are these five men actually to
casually dismiss someone like Akainu and be

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:43.230
in the same room as one of the Yonko without
guards?

00:02:43.230 --> 00:02:46.990
And will the marines ultimately rebel against
them?

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:50.730
What's up, my name is Manu and even though
I might not look it, I'm actually very interested

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:55.600
in politics and history, learning about how
we get where we are today and how societies

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:58.320
thrive or fail under different political systems.

00:02:58.320 --> 00:03:03.470
And I think in terms of One Piece it doesn't
get much more political than when talking

00:03:03.470 --> 00:03:08.910
about the 5 elders, who run and govern the
entire planet.

00:03:08.910 --> 00:03:13.970
In fact what I find absolutely fascinating,
is that if you only have a vague idea of what

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:21.010
One Piece is actually about, you'd probably
be absolutely taken aback just how much politics

00:03:21.010 --> 00:03:31.880
is actually hidden under the classic layers
of a Shounen Manga.

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:36.560
Not only do we encounter different political
systems and structures with every new island

00:03:36.560 --> 00:03:41.690
we visit, but as the story progresses we learn
more and more about the workings of a political

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:45.090
organisation that rules the entire world.

00:03:45.090 --> 00:03:50.110
Which, now that I think about it, is actually
pretty hilarious, because usually Shounen

00:03:50.110 --> 00:03:56.450
Manga are about stopping an evil force from
reaching world domination, while in One Piece

00:03:56.450 --> 00:04:00.050
this has already happened centuries ago.

00:04:00.050 --> 00:04:05.040
And so the world of one piece is actually
a true dystopia, where a small group of inbred

00:04:05.040 --> 00:04:10.600
and cruel nobles living on top of the red
line hold most of the wealth, enslave and

00:04:10.600 --> 00:04:23.070
kill people at will and brainwash the people
with propaganda and lies.

00:04:23.070 --> 00:04:27.730
All while the people on the sea below live
in poverty and despair and also in fear of

00:04:27.730 --> 00:04:33.100
a culture of pirates, that has formed form
these desperate conditions.

00:04:33.100 --> 00:04:38.010
What I love so much about Eiichiro Oda, the
author of one piece, is how he managed to

00:04:38.010 --> 00:04:44.450
hide this dark and complex political foundation
of his story under the mantel of the positive

00:04:44.450 --> 00:04:56.820
and fun adventure Luffy and co are on.

00:04:56.820 --> 00:05:02.350
So even if you're someone who isn't really
into the politics of a story, you still know

00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:05.820
exactly what's going on without you even realizing
it.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:10.290
And it also makes the story enjoyable for
a younger shounen audience, with the deeper

00:05:10.290 --> 00:05:13.650
and darker parts still being clearly visible
for the adults.

00:05:13.650 --> 00:05:19.990
To me that once again shows what a masterful
writer Oda-sensei truly is.

00:05:19.990 --> 00:05:24.199
In a way, you could argue, that the fight
of the ancient kingdom vs what would later

00:05:24.199 --> 00:05:28.389
become the world government was the classic
Shounen setting.

00:05:28.389 --> 00:05:33.050
Luffy on the other hand is a hero that doesn't
just have to stop the bad guys from winning,

00:05:33.050 --> 00:05:39.949
he has to change and liberate an entire planet,
that has been ruled and indoctrinated for

00:05:39.949 --> 00:05:42.510
almost 1000 years.

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:47.400
Which makes things much more interesting,
because it's not enough to just beat the big

00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:50.560
bad guy to keep everything the way it is.

00:05:50.560 --> 00:05:55.600
Luffy as the hero, has to actually present
the world with a system that works better

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:56.850
than the current one.

00:05:56.850 --> 00:06:01.840
And I'm very curious how people will react
to the ideal system Oda envisions for the

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.130
end of the story.

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:09.300
No matter what it is it's probably gonna be
controversial, similarly how we all kept wondering

00:06:09.300 --> 00:06:13.090
what political system the end of game of thrones
would bring with it.

00:06:13.090 --> 00:06:15.760
Will the world of One Piece have a king?

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:16.990
Complete anarchy?

00:06:16.990 --> 00:06:19.229
A democracy?

00:06:19.229 --> 00:06:23.800
This will have a big impact on all Luffy is
achieving right now.

00:06:23.800 --> 00:06:27.680
So who are these five men that tule the world
with an iron fist.

00:06:27.680 --> 00:06:29.500
Are they good or evil?

00:06:29.500 --> 00:06:31.000
How powerful are they?

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:33.580
And if they truly are immortal, how?

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:40.760
And what would it mean for the story if they
came form the void century.

00:06:40.760 --> 00:06:45.680
In case you need a refresher, the five elders,
or Gorosei, as they are called in Japanese,

00:06:45.680 --> 00:06:51.780
are a council of the most highly ranked Celestial
Dragons with full control over the Marines,

00:06:51.780 --> 00:06:56.080
the cipher pole agencies and even the seven
Warlords of the sea.

00:06:56.080 --> 00:07:00.360
While we know neither their names nor their
power, we have seen them pulling the strings

00:07:00.360 --> 00:07:06.540
behind almost everything happening in the
world, politically rivalled only by the influence

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:11.600
of the four emperors, that actually hold both
the necessary political and military power

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:15.390
to deny the world government and rule over
the new world.

00:07:15.390 --> 00:07:20.650
Now quite recently, we have learned that the
Gorosei actually serve a mysterious figure

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:26.250
called Imu, who rules the world from the shadows.

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:35.100
However, while the elders obey his orders,
it very much seems like most of the time they

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.710
still have full authority over the governments
actions.

00:07:38.710 --> 00:07:44.729
Now, as you can imagine, tyranically running
an entire planet as a shadow government can

00:07:44.729 --> 00:07:46.949
be an increadibly tiring job.

00:07:46.949 --> 00:07:49.100
If you have a similar problem to the gorosei,
dealing with stressful fleet admirals, removing

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.190
parts of history and preparing big cleanses,
I got just the thing for you to sweeten your

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.190
day.

